sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite (FTS5 + vectors)
  participant L as LLM API
  participant V as Verifier (code)

  U->>FE: Ask question
  FE->>API: POST /api/chat (UI shows spinner)
  opt Follow-up (there is chat history)
    API->>L: Rewrite the message as a standalone question (last 2 messages)
    L-->>API: Standalone question (raw message if the call fails)
  end
  API->>API: Scope: report(s) whose company is named in the question, else all
  API->>L: Embed the standalone question
  L-->>API: Query vector
  API->>DB: BM25 top 20 + cosine top 20 (scoped chunks)
  DB-->>API: Candidates
  API->>API: Reciprocal Rank Fusion, keep top 8
  API->>API: Assemble context: dedupe, token budget, tags S1..Sn
  API->>L: System rules + sources + last 2 messages + question
  L-->>API: JSON: status, answer, citations with quotes
  API->>V: Is each quote a substring of its source? Is value in quote (when the citation has one)?
  V-->>API: Verified or unverified per citation
  API->>DB: Persist user and assistant messages with citations
  API-->>FE: ChatResponse JSON
  FE-->>U: Answer + verbatim quotes + page numbers
